ikin maganganun Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › Sura Al-Jumu&#x27;a</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Jumu&#x27;a — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</h1><section><p>Ayoyin wannan sura da ke da bayani:</p><div class=\"vl\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/62-2.html\">2</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/62-3.html\">3</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/62-5.html\">5</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/62-9.html\">9</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/62-10.html\">10</a></div></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s62a1\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}